{"id":30055,"bangumiId":30055,"type":2,"name":"Fate/Prototype","name_cn":"Fate/Prototype","date":"2011-12-31","year":"2011","region":"jp","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/11/34/30055_GrfZ7.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/11/34/30055_GrfZ7.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/11/34/30055_GrfZ7.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/11/34/30055_GrfZ7.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/11/34/30055_GrfZ7.jpg"},"summary":"第七位的菜鸟魔术师被卷入名为圣杯战争的魔术师之间的战斗，在骚乱的最后召唤出了第一位的Servant Saber，并成为Master奔波于夜色之中……这个耳熟能详的故事开始，虽然「Fate/Prototype」是「Fate/stay night」的原型作品，但在设定上还是有不少的不同，当中最大的分别莫过于Saber这对仆役了，在Fate/Stay Night中作为主角的卫官士郎在Prototype中并未出场，Prototype中主角是一名叫沙条绫香的女生，而Saber则是男性而非女性。好胜、聪慧却多少给人以有些厌世的出家人之感的绫香，以及立于少女背后一遍嘴里损个不停一边微笑着守护她的Saber，两人的组合就是这样一种关系，参照Fate/Stay Night中远坂凛和Archer（英灵卫宫）的组合就可以很好的理解。因此沙条绫香与卫宫士郎的关系并非是原型或性转这么简单，非要说的话，沙条绫香可以说是远坂凛一部分的原型。「Fate/Prototype」是作者奈须蘑菇在中学时就构思出来的，对后来的「Fate/stay night」和其他Fate系列作品创作都有很大的影响。","rating":{"rank":3308,"total":2221,"count":{"1":6,"2":5,"3":7,"4":28,"5":191,"6":598,"7":799,"8":434,"9":85,"10":68},"score":6.8},"collection":{"on_hold":138,"dropped":51,"wish":985,"collect":3863,"doing":99},"tags":[{"name":"Type-Moon","count":676,"total_count":68664},{"name":"OVA","count":590,"total_count":371706},{"name":"巨坑","count":382,"total_count":1510},{"name":"Fate","count":340,"total_count":47728},{"name":"2011","count":259,"total_count":53929},{"name":"FATE原作","count":207,"total_count":208},{"name":"ufotable","count":177,"total_count":55948},{"name":"Lerche","count":168,"total_count":15785},{"name":"花泽香菜","count":140,"total_count":43602},{"name":"废弃原设","count":112,"total_count":112},{"name":"原创","count":93,"total_count":635514},{"name":"岸诚二","count":74,"total_count":9827},{"name":"旧剑","count":73,"total_count":73},{"name":"回收利用","count":59,"total_count":59},{"name":"Fate系列","count":57,"total_count":286},{"name":"战斗","count":53,"total_count":488918}],"eps":1,"total_